## SQ-LGM-11 | pufferfish broth gives Comfort 1200 and Nausea 100, no poison
@group A
@commands Bot eats `largemeals:pufferfish_broth`; `/data get entity` the bot `ActiveEffects`
@pass Comfort 1200 ticks and Nausea (`minecraft:nausea`) 100 ticks; no poison (LGM-22)
@fails `MealItems.java` not in the nested jar
@jars creativedelight
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
> zp hunger c2b 4
> pbot hold c2b largemeals:pufferfish_broth 1
> zp eat c2b
> zp effects c2b
waitlog \[zp\] effects 20
expect \[zp\] effects c2b: .*farmersdelight:comfort amp 0 1[12]\d\dt
expect \[zp\] effects c2b: .*minecraft:nausea amp 0 \d+t
reject \[zp\] effects c2b: .*minecraft:poison
look Nausea about 100 ticks
> effect clear c2b

## SQ-LGM-12 | feast can recipes for omurice, pot pie, mutton rack; no can takes a raw / cooked rack
@group A
@commands Recipe dump: `canned_omurice`, `canned_mushroom_pot_pie`, `canned_roasted_mutton_rack`; uses of `largemeals:raw_mutton_rack` / `cooked_mutton_rack`
@pass three feast can recipes on the placed block, uncanning gives the serving; no can recipe takes either rack (LGM-23, -24)
@fails `largemeals` still in `AWAIT_DUMP`
@jars creativedelight
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
> zq rdetail canned_omurice
> zq rdetail canned_mushroom_pot_pie
> zq rdetail canned_roasted_mutton_rack
> zq uses largemeals:raw_mutton_rack
> zq uses largemeals:cooked_mutton_rack
waitlog uses largemeals:cooked_mutton_rack 20
reject (alone|shared) creativedelight:\S*canned_\S*
look each can recipe takes the placed feast block (or its servings) and an empty can; uncanning (if listed) gives the serving; note: tools/gen_can_types.py AWAIT_DUMP still lists largemeals and roll_delight (the row's pre-run step was not done), so judge the live recipes as they are

## SQ-LGM-13 | food families of Large Meals dishes (generated catalog) and the whole-block tags live
@group A
@commands `food_families.json` after `/cdevgen` (rerun after 2026-11-14, plan_bugfix_1114.md 7.4: whole blocks now in the JSON; offline regeneration already shows all five); `/kubejs list_tag minecraft:item creativedelight:food_family/feast/whole` and `.../cake/whole`
@pass Mushroom Pot Pie block `feast/whole`, serving `feast/serving`; Omurice `feast/*`; Tomato Egg Soup `soup/soup`; Cod Deluxe and Hearty Lunch `meal/plate`; both tags list their block items (cake/whole holds `minecraft:cake`), no tag load error
@fails name rule ahead of `FAMILY_OVERRIDE`; members filter in `food_families.py` main()
@jars creativedelight
@from batches/r1115/p1_a1.qb
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/c2_famcheck.py families largemeals:mushroom_pot_pie largemeals:mushroom_pot_pie_block largemeals:omurice largemeals:omurice_block largemeals:tomato_egg_soup largemeals:cod_deluxe largemeals:hearty_lunch
> kubejs list_tag minecraft:item creativedelight:food_family/feast/whole
> kubejs list_tag minecraft:item creativedelight:food_family/cake/whole
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_family/feast/whole
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_family/cake/whole
waitlog \[zq\] itemtag creativedelight:food_family/cake/whole 30
bootreject Couldn't load tag.*food_family
expect itemtag creativedelight:food_family/cake/whole \(\d+\): .*minecraft:cake
look pot pie block feast/whole, serving feast/serving; omurice feast/*; tomato egg soup soup/soup; cod deluxe and hearty lunch meal/plate; both tags list block items

