## SQ-BBQ2-01 | after /reload no skewer script error; the 8 pack raw skewers exist under their mods
@group A
@commands `grep -E "barbequesdelight\|skewers.js\|F.skewer" logs/kubejs/server.log` after `/reload`; registry check for the 8 raw ids (`/give` each)
@pass no script error; all 8 raw skewers exist under their mods' namespaces
@fails `PackRawSkewers` not registered
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
> zc2 reg item ^(farmersdelight:raw_barbecue_stick|hostiledelight:raw_caveskewer|endersdelight:raw_crispy_skewer|ends_delight:raw_end_barbecue_stick|miners_delight:raw_improvised_barbecue_stick|nethersdelight:raw_nether_skewer|oceanic_delight:raw_seafood_skewer|veggiesdelight:raw_turnip_mutton_skewer)$
> reload
sleep 25
shell grep -nE "barbequesdelight|skewers\.js|F\.skewer" logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -iE "error|warn" | head -8 | cut -c1-240; true
expect \[zc2\] reg item \S+: 8\b
look no error / warn line from the shell grep (server.log restarted by the reload)

